, "Co3jD0": {"type":"text","parent":"yK8pG0","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Preview (topbar Play button, ⇧Space, View › Preview) replaces the whole editor window content in place — panels, toolbar, agent, selection and overlays all hidden — with a dark neutral stage (#0E0E10, fixed in both app themes so the design reads as the only light). The selected top-level frame (or the first frame of the page) renders zoomed to fit with 24 px margin; a 44 px bar carries frame name, ‹ 2 / 5 › through the page's top-level frames in layer order, light/dark + theme axis pins (preview-only, never written to the file), zoom (Fit · 50 · 100 · 200 %) and Exit (esc).","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

