, "G7pxmZ": {"type":"text","parent":"qzpoc0","order":"a2","name":"Intro","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"A wizard that gets a relay running without Kimo running any server. Pick where it lives: this computer, Docker or your own server, Fly.io, Railway, or a relay you already have. Kimo fills in this device's public key and allowed origins, does the one-click parts it can, gives copy buttons for the rest, then tests the relay and saves its URL. Relays Kimo starts are yours from the start; others are claimed in the test, so only your devices can start sharing on them. Nothing to copy or keep private.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-lg"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

