, "K5ZDB0": {"type":"text","parent":"L2qTa0","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Each file becomes a rectangle with an image fill (mode Fill), named after the file without extension, selected after import. Size: natural pixels (1 px = 1 unit, @2x-named files halved), then scaled down — ratio kept — to fit the target frame's content width, or 80 % of the viewport on empty canvas. Several files: auto-layout target → consecutive children; elsewhere a row with 16 px gaps. Bytes go into the file's assets (hash-named, de-duplicated). Animated GIF keeps the file; the canvas shows frame 1.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

