, "KEypW0": {"type":"text","parent":"I4Q62u","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"One sheet, three columns, grouped by where you are. Every row is a real binding from Editor.tsx / controller.ts / LeftPanel.tsx / CanvasHost.tsx / conflicts/shortcut.ts / SettingsDialog.tsx — the only new one is ⌘/ to open this sheet (badge 'new'). Keys render with the shared Kbd (Eo5JW); alternates are joined by 'or'. The platform switch re-renders modifiers (Ctrl / Alt) and defaults to the current OS. Filter matches action names and keys.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

