, "Qv5HE0": {"type":"text","parent":"k2EVmw","order":"a1","name":"Spec","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Uses Bun. If Bun is missing, Install Bun runs the official bun.sh installer after a confirm that shows the exact command, the install location (~/.bun, user only) and that it needs network; progress as log lines, then success. Install it myself shows the one-liner and Re-check. Port 8787, next free if taken. Same-network address always shown. Stops when Kimo quits, after a confirm if people are connected.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-xs"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

