, "V6rbPC": {"type":"text","parent":"SLbjc0","order":"a2","name":"Intro","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"The last v1 promises about fonts: a Google font is fetched once and stored in the file's assets/ folder by content hash, so the file renders offline, in CI, in the kimo CLI and in headless render. 'No third-party fetch' stops every request to Google, and an optional offline font pack keeps a small curated set of families on this device. Built from the Settings pane rows of board 19, the Missing fonts dialog and the Code tab of board 25; closed by a rules table.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-lg"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

