, "W0Rn86": {"type":"text","parent":"oh4m70","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Broken = an override whose target layer id or bound variable no longer resolves (after edits to the main, Replace with selection, or a library update). The instance panel shows a $warning-soft strip; 'Review' opens this dialog (also from the layer context menu and Libraries panel). Per row: Remap (suggested by name match, any layer of matching type) · Reset (drop the override) · Keep (stays broken, hidden from canvas). Nothing changes until Apply.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

