, "W0hBA0": {"type":"text","parent":"p7iSM0","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Downloading: the Value + button pair becomes a 160 px Progress (track + 'x of y MB') and Cancel; the description counts faces, and the fonts apply when it finishes. Downloaded: size + Remove (ghost, no confirm — it's a cache). Blocked: the whole row dims to 45 % like Google Fonts on board 19; a downloaded pack still renders. Stopped (network error, or Cancel with nothing kept): back to Download, which resumes and skips faces already stored.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

