, "YJiHS0": {"type":"text","parent":"PviiG0","order":"a1","name":"Rationale","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Components need an identity that survives on any user canvas and never reads as selection (blue), agent (teal), measure (magenta) or status. Ink-only glyphs and dashed outlines vanish on ink-heavy designs and collide with dashed slot/measure guides, so M3 adds one hue, component (violet, Figma's convention), used only for: main/instance glyphs, main/instance canvas outlines and labels, slot outlines and badges, and the override dot. It is never used for actions or chrome.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.5},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

