, "Z3n490": {"type":"text","parent":"v635bP","order":"a2","name":"Intro","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"What a window shows from its first paint until the editor mounts. Pure HTML + CSS in index.html — no script, no web font, no request — so it is on screen before the app bundle is even parsed. The X2 mark (KimoLogo, board 26) sits centred on $bg-app and turns a half turn with a soft pucker; after 3 s a mono status line says what is happening; once React mounts, the whole layer fades out in 180 ms. Light and dark follow the stored theme (else the system), reduced motion swaps the turn for an opacity pulse. Closed by a rules table.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-lg"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

