, "Z9Ygc0": {"type":"text","parent":"h0cqV3","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Pointer in the top/bottom quarter of a row = Between (indent follows the pointer's x, so you can drop a level up at the end of a group); middle half of a frame/group row = Into (row outlined, auto-expands after 600 ms hover). Invalid targets — inside an instance, into a non-container, a node into its own descendant — draw the line in $danger, show a not-allowed cursor and a tooltip; release = no-op. Multi-select drags as one block; one undo step.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

