, "ZhuBF0": {"type":"text","parent":"ZiXT30","order":"a1","name":"Body","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"PageRow is quieter than LayerRow on purpose: no disclosure, no type icon, a check for the current page (Figma/Sketch convention) and an optional mono layer count. PaletteRow is the ⌘P switcher row (Active shows the ↵ key). DropIndicator: Between = 2 px $selection line with a hollow 8 px ring at the target indent; Invalid = the same in $danger (+ not-allowed cursor). LayerRow/DropTarget = the 'into' state: 1.5 px $selection outline + $selection-soft + corner-down-right glyph. InsertionBar is the canvas twin for auto layout (2 px bar, 6 px end caps, always $selection). PropField/Bindable shows the 'variable' bind button on hover; PropField/Bound swaps the value for a variable chip, resolved value trailing in mono, Detach (unlink) on hover.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-xs"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

