, "aKwqB0": {"type":"text","parent":"J5Vng0","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Entering path edit (Enter or double-click a path) shows this toolbar 12 px above the path's bounds, replacing the floating toolbar. Smooth/Sharp reflects the selected anchor(s) — mixed shows neither active; double-click an anchor also toggles. Scissors splits the path at the selected anchor (open path → two paths; closed → opened). A clicked segment highlights in 3 px $selection; ⌫ removes just that segment. Done / Esc / Enter exits.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

