, "f5ZFpp": {"type":"text","parent":"EPJ4x0","order":"a2","name":"Intro","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Ten areas the user guide had to hedge around: pages, clipboard and structure edits, raster import, view options, polygon/star and pen extras, the missing property controls, variable binding on every field, component flows, Preview, and the agent/export leftovers. Each section is a set of in-context vignettes built from existing components and tokens, closed by a rules table the builders can implement against. Monochrome by default; colour only where it means something — selection blue for targets and insertion, danger for invalid drops, component violet, agent teal, measure magenta.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-lg"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

