, "fMpxe0": {"type":"text","parent":"qLofz0","order":"a2","name":"Intro","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"While the agent works, the thread shows one live status line — what it is doing right now, in its own short words, with the elapsed time and a Follow chip — instead of streaming its text and token counts. The design lands on the canvas step by step: each edit adds one finished section, flashing in the agent's hue as it lands, and the agent cursor moves to the last layer it added; the viewport never moves on its own. The written reply appears when the turn ends, with its steps folded behind a small \"N steps\" toggle (always folded by default; a failed step only adds a red count) and tokens, cost and duration on hover. Closed by a rules table.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-lg"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

