, "ftP090": {"type":"text","parent":"xng480","order":"a0","name":"Text","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Nothing about tokens or cost is shown while the turn runs — the live \"Streaming · 2.8k in · 312 out\" meta is gone. Once the turn ends, the MessageMeta row (tokens · cost · duration · Copy · Regenerate) keeps its 15 px row under the reply but stays invisible until the pointer is over the agent turn or focus is inside it, so nothing jumps. Show cost off (Settings › AI providers) hides the $ as before; subscription CLIs show \"subscription\". The per-turn cost warning above the composer is unchanged.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

