, "h3NJcP": {"type":"text","parent":"ehXaq0","order":"a1","name":"Spec","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"One 60° beat per 2000 ms loop at 30 fps: the spiked outer shape turns clockwise 0° → +60°, the pucker opening turns counter-clockwise 0° → −60°, both about the mark centre (50, 50). 0–700 ms ease-in cubic-bezier(0.32, 0, 0.67, 0) to ±30°, 700–1400 ms ease-out cubic-bezier(0.33, 1, 0.68, 1) to ±60°, 1400–2000 ms rest.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-xs"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

