, "h6JPi0": {"type":"text","parent":"V7ey1Q","order":"a2","name":"Note","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Decision: no save dialog up front. New file opens an untitled document instantly (recovery autosave only). The first ⌘S (or closing / quitting with edits) opens the native save panel pre-filled with \"Untitled.kimo\" in the last-used folder. After saving: breadcrumb shows folder / file, SaveStatus switches to \"Saved to disk\", autosave writes to the file from then on, and the file joins Open recent. Web: ⌘S on an untitled file triggers Save as….","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-xs"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.5},"fill":{"$ref":"text-tertiary"}}

