, "k7qDp0": {"type":"text","parent":"nCiET0","order":"a2","name":"Intro","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"A hosted relay with no setup, for owners who would rather not run one. Kimo Cloud is listed first in the relay wizard and the Share popover; self-hosting stays free and stays there. Owners sign in with an email link, subscribe in the payment provider's checkout, and share. Guests still join by link with no account. Edits stay end-to-end encrypted: Kimo Cloud stores ciphertext and never sees the design. ADR 0018.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-lg"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

