, "m93JdS": {"type":"text","parent":"R8OJ30","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Paste target order: (1) a single selected frame/group that is not an instance → pasted as its last child (auto layout: appended; free: same offset as copied, nudged +16 until it doesn't cover an identical sibling); (2) pointer inside the viewport → centred on the pointer; (3) viewport centre. The parent flashes a 1 px $selection outline for 600 ms and the toast names where it went. Copy shows no toast (the Edit menu flashes); cut = copy + delete.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

