, "mQoZ90": {"type":"text","parent":"PAfvv0","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Hovering any bindable field reveals a 20 px 'variable' button at its right edge (focus also shows it; ⌥-click the label is the shortcut). Bound fields replace the value with a variable chip — glyph by type (hash number · type string · toggle-left boolean), mono name, the resolved value trailing in tertiary mono. Hover a bound field → unlink button = Detach (keeps the resolved value). Missing variable: $danger chip outline + strikethrough; value falls back to the last resolved one.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

