, "muMQN0": {"type":"text","parent":"p8g4h0","order":"a1","name":"Spec","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"MessageMeta (tokens · cost · duration · Copy · Regenerate) keeps its row under the turn but is invisible until hover or focus-within on the agent turn. Tokens are new tokens only: input not served from the prompt cache plus output (\"21.1k new tokens\"); cached re-reads of the prompt are not counted, and the tooltip gives the split. The thread header and the usage ledger count the same way. The live streaming tokens meta is removed. Show cost off hides $; the per-turn cost warning card stays.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-xs"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

