, "r8Cw9l": {"type":"text","parent":"vgvYj0","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"While files are dragged over the window the canvas gets a 2 px $selection inset border + 4 % tint and a bottom pill naming what will be imported. The frame under the pointer is the target: 2 px $selection outline + a tag; auto-layout targets also show the InsertionBar. Over empty canvas there's no target — images land at the pointer. Unsupported files in the drag turn the pill to '1 of 3 can't be imported' (still droppable for the rest).","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

