, "scQmI0": {"type":"text","parent":"c3G3v0","order":"a2","name":"Intro","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Bring your own key, any provider, no account. The in-app agent drives the same tool registry, approvals, activity log and presence as external MCP agents (ADR 0013) — so its scopes are enforced by the ops layer, not by the prompt. Everything the agent does stays teal.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-lg"},"weight":400},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

, "scR4E0": {"type":"text","parent":"F2Etg0","order":"a1","name":"Spec","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"A Google face fetched for the canvas is written once to the file's assets/<sha256-16>.<ext>; the next save lists it in the manifest (font/woff2 or font/ttf, name '<Family>-<Style>.<ext>'). Never an edit of the open document: no undo step, opening never dirties the file. Files over 20 MB are skipped (still cached).","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-xs"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

