, "t3vQL0": {"type":"text","parent":"ipOV90","order":"a1","name":"Text","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Decision needed — personas extend the agent colour system. Today “teal = agent” is a single semantic (one $agent / $agent-2 / $agent-soft triple). Parallel agents would need per-persona triples ($agent-iris, $agent-iris-2, $agent-iris-soft …) in light + dark, a rule for which persona an agent gets (stable per host? per session?), and a check that canvas selection, presence cursors, placeholder tags and diff highlights stay teal-only or follow the persona. Recommend deciding the count (4 vs 6) before building.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-primary"}}

