, "uV7nK0": {"type":"text","parent":"VCSml0","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Crop is a fourth image fit mode (Fill · Fit · Stretch · Crop). Choosing it — or double-clicking an image fill — enters crop mode: the whole source shows, outside the crop dimmed to #14141499, white 1 px box with thirds, 3 px corner brackets and edge bars; ⇧ keeps ratio. The panel mirrors the crop rect in source px. Enter/Apply commits to fill.transform; Esc reverts; Reset = whole image. The layer's own size never changes.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

