, "vB1re0": {"type":"text","parent":"p7lba0","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Refusal is not an error: neutral card ($bg-subtle, border) with icon hand in text-secondary, the model's own one-line reason, and 'Edit request' (prefills the composer). Generic error reuses AgentErrorCard (Ny3kQ) with icon circle-x — the fallback when no specific state (key, rate limit, offline, spending, browser) matches.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

