, "vQmrs0": {"type":"text","parent":"ICb890","order":"a2","name":"Decision","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Polygon and Star are one 'Polygon' panel section with a Polygon | Star segmented switch (SegmentedText). Sides/Points 3–60, Radius rounds every corner, Ratio (star only) = inner/outer radius. On canvas, star shows a hollow ratio handle and a filled radius handle on the top point; dragging shows a $selection MeasurePill. Polygon stays a native polygon node (polygonCount + cornerRadius); Star is stored as {type:'polygon', star:{ratio}} so it stays parametric, exported as a path.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-sm"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

