, "vb5iZ0": {"type":"text","parent":"y40EjG","order":"a1","name":"Spec","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"A fresh relay has no owner. This computer, Docker and Fly start the relay with this device's public key (KIMO_OWNER_KEY, shown truncated, safe to show), so the test reads yours. Railway and I already have a relay are claimed in the test step (claimed by you), or on the first Start sharing. After that only paired devices can start sharing on it. Joining by link is unchanged.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"font":{"$ref":"font-sans"},"size":{"$ref":"text-xs"},"weight":400,"lineHeight":1.45},"fill":{"$ref":"text-secondary"}}

